ReSAIL

This distribution contains a modified subset of Slime:
https://github.com/THUDM/slime
Copyright 2025 Zhipu AI

ReSAIL changes include iterative agent self-distillation, ALFWorld and
TextCraft integration, sensitivity-guided selection, trajectory loss
balancing, privileged retention, and experiment and evaluation workflows.
Modified upstream files carry a ReSAIL modification notice. Existing
copyright, license, and attribution notices are retained.

The distribution also retains source attribution for code derived from
OpenRLHF, verl, and the EleutherAI language model evaluation harness in
the corresponding files. See LICENSE for the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Model weights, task datasets, and external runtime dependencies are
obtained separately and remain subject to their own licenses.
